    "instructions": "Write `two_sum(nums: list[int], target: int) -> list[int]` returning 0-indexed positions [i, j] of two numbers summing to target.",
    "starter_code": "def two_sum(nums: list[int], target: int) -> list[int]:\n    pass\n",
    "solution_code": "def two_sum(nums: list[int], target: int) -> list[int]:\n    seen = {}\n    for i, x in enumerate(nums):\n        diff = target - x\n        if diff in seen:\n            return [seen[diff], i]\n        seen[x] = i\n    return []\n",
